    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1687527367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1687527367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1687527367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A puzzle game where the player will have to find the correct position of the block so that the correct figure is formed to complete the level.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/7d28f954537060e37d46e99e26510180.poster.avif?t=1687527367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/7d28f954537060e37d46e99e26510180.webm?t=1687527367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/7d28f954537060e37d46e99e26510180.mp4?t=1687527367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels with increasing difficulty.<br></li><li> Beautiful art<br></li><li> Relaxing soundtrack.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/e9aecc70be93377dd6b5a717119913ce.poster.avif?t=1687527367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/e9aecc70be93377dd6b5a717119913ce.webm?t=1687527367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529770/extras/e9aecc70be93377dd6b5a717119913ce.mp4?t=1687527367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
